1
00:00:00,413 --> 00:00:03,123
(Raj:)You still might get on a magazine.

2
00:00:04,333 --> 00:00:07,923
(Howard:)- You guys are seriously considering this?
- Yes.

3
00:00:08,087 --> 00:00:12,087
(Howard:)- You think you can put up with Sheldon?
- Well, I'm a Hindu.

4
00:00:12,258 --> 00:00:17,098
(Raj:)My religion teaches that if we suffer
in this life, we are rewarded in the next.

5
00:00:17,263 --> 00:00:19,893
(Raj:)Three months at the North Pole
with Sheldon...

6
00:00:20,057 --> 00:00:23,857
(Raj:)...and I'm reborn
as a well-hung billionaire with wings.

7
00:00:30,693 --> 00:00:33,363
(Sheldon:)Well, gentlemen,
have you reached a decision?

8
00:00:34,071 --> 00:00:37,201
- I'm in.
- Me too.

9
00:00:38,701 --> 00:00:40,491
(Howard:)Damn it. Peer pressure. Fine.

10
00:00:42,121 --> 00:00:45,751
(Sheldon:)Excellent. And just an FYI,
as I am the expedition's team leader...

11
00:00:45,916 --> 00:00:49,166
(Sheldon:)...protocol dictates that be phrased,
"Fine, sir."

12
00:00:49,336 --> 00:00:52,466
(Sheldon:)But don't worry,
there will be a briefing.

13
00:00:56,093 --> 00:01:00,023
Pssh!

